  "description": "closed issue https://github.com/IBM/mcp-context-forge/issues/1318\r\n\r\nThis pull request adds advanced filtering and search capabilities to the *Edit Server* form, improving usability and discoverability.\r\n\r\n### **Key Features Added**\r\n\r\n#### **1. MCP Server Filtering**\r\n\r\n* Introduced a searchable, selectable list of MCP Servers.\r\n* Added **Select All** and **Clear All** actions.\r\n* Included a dedicated **REST** server option.\r\n* Added visual **pills** to display selected servers.\r\n\r\n#### **2. Tools, Resources & Prompts Search**\r\n\r\n* Added search inputs to filter associated **Tools**, **Resources**, and **Prompts** by name.\r\n",
